        "id": 2022314
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-18T22:45:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But what\u0027s the problem to access them through hypercalls from the beginning?\n\nAlso just wondering: so still not all such accesses are prevented by aosp/3786912 ?",
      "parentUuid": "a7db6a40_84633953",
      "revId": "bcc18e7562506fc1e9414c064167da4ccdd5deec",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fc0c9872_d03cc1ff",
        "filename": "drivers/iommu/intel/iommu.h",
        "patchSetId": 34
      },
      "lineNbr": 778,
